/* Pool LED Control 2.1.0 - Seeed XIAO ESP32-S3
 * GPIO1 (D0): RGB DATA; GPIO2 (D1): white DATA; GPIO4 (D3): button to GND.
 * RGB/white strips: external 24 V. NEVER connect 24 V to ESP pins.
 * Requires Arduino-ESP32 and Adafruit NeoPixel. No ArduinoJson dependency.
 * First installation: merged firmware over USB. Later OTA: APPLICATION BIN only.
 * Preserve two OTA slots and a data/spiffs partition named "spiffs" for LittleFS.
 */
